# Social Comment
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Social — an ordinary one-to-many: each Comment belongs to exactly one Post
# and one Author, but (unlike a pure child-table row) has its own identity and can be
# queried independently — "all comments by this user across every post"
# Case 11 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: social-post.menata

Comment

Fields

- Post : Post
- Author : User
- Body : Rich Text
- Commented At : Date Time

Events

When Comment

    Post Comment Count plus 1

Constraints

- Post is required.
- Body is required.

Permissions

Member

- Comment

Views

- Post Comments : List
- My Comments : List
